{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"fe91d7d564dd552e5b57cedfe3d0911c27558d2c9c1beb46568db202515d941f","ja":"漏れ出す本音","zh":"流露出的真心","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"04f49b2eec9f26585a4b1df86231935d1aea3e0214e80723862d0ae1ae8a8b01","ja":"うあうあ～、雑誌の取材、どうしよ～っ！\n亜美、ホラーな感想しか出てこないよ～！","zh":"呜哇呜哇～，杂志采访该怎么办啊～！\n亚美满脑子都只能想到恐怖的感想啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"0e526c40ffe6c5a490e445726945c539d024448970c824b6187af3de6fb38ad2","ja":"恋愛映画らしい感想を\n考えないといけませんね……。","zh":"得想出一段符合爱情电影风格的\n感想才行呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"74451cf4e9af9a7bf43ae5823842ed7368bf7365a93d5293b9d58593730e90b0","ja":"うぅ……ですが、あの女の子の\n恐ろしい表情ばかり浮かんできて……。","zh":"呜呜……可是，我脑海中\n全都是那个女孩子可怕的表情……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8dcde180b0db8b2b6c8db7cba263833a05a6aad1d3bf1b881ef4bf0ebedba6b2","ja":"コンコン。\n「取材、始めてもよろしいでしょうか？」","zh":"咚咚。\n“可以开始采访了吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"3b8f16c325af54edd699f85d06a3122e2b7b173d1eb56e45c935c7452abd5f6e","ja":"わっ、もう！？\nは、はい……！？","zh":"哇，已经到了吗！？\n好、好的……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a53eaa2415b1993db3f8e88c83cad67c72b8d1a9ae19b25076cc81f2c3bee5f8","ja":"「失礼します！　試写会お疲れ様でした。さっそく\nみなさんの感想をお聞きしてもよろしいでしょうか？」","zh":"“打扰了！试映会辛苦各位了。\n方便立刻听听大家的感想吗？”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"1d83b37c144e59d3ffd25f3989bef385c829e0a3a819a35a2ca31e2cc9e95bb9","ja":"え、えっと……「許さない」って拳をにぎりしめる\n女の子の迫力が……ものすごくって……。","zh":"那个、这个嘛……说着“不可饶恕”并握紧拳头的\n女孩子那股气势……真的好惊人……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2b65cab6b6ab0624e87ed88c6446f8087b4d3d6aa67bde1c03aa28c6227cc1a9","ja":"そうそう、もう二度と逃げられないって感じで。\n他にも病院のシーンとか……。","zh":"对对，就像是再也逃不掉了一样。\n还有医院的场景什么的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9d70aa19dcb529e8342e44341450f2b05b6540edb28b492e2c20e2e396958213","ja":"って、これって怖いとこばっかじゃん！\nエミリーはどう思った！？","zh":"等等，这不全都是吓人的地方嘛！\n艾米莉是怎么想的！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"6809e47d3a95cab583ce86dfb3052bed5be33bdce7af5d1bf5c93e62a1f16a1e","ja":"は、はい。やはり山場はあの崖の場面かと……。\n女の子がにらみつけてきた瞬間、叫びそうに……！","zh":"是、是的。高潮果然还是悬崖的那一幕吧……\n那个女孩子瞪过来的瞬间，我差点就叫出来了……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"9e1f830a9a2acab1e97aa53c9bfd349bcf8ea326888c261aa7b5c0051f91d94e","ja":"なでしこもホラー映画の感想になってるよ！？\nもっと恋愛映画っぽいこと言わないと。","zh":"抚子你也变成在说恐怖电影的感想了啦！？\n不多说点像爱情电影一样的内容可不行哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"c4a258f8df856b79e49ec764ed064ad245aa286ba78c52f9af23993a88b941a3","ja":"亜美はね、誰かを好きになるってめっちゃイイなって\n思ったよ。ずっとその人のことを考えて、考えて……。","zh":"亜美觉得呀，喜欢上一个人真的超棒的。\n心里一直想着那个人，想着想着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"c9ff98866578ef540cb603735e5a30e7e3a9883cdb1c9d4ae5b171655f1d2abf","ja":"考えすぎだよ～～～っ！","zh":"想太多啦～～～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"cb094826fec72d697f6329c733158c805eb702b8475898f3d0276a95fec0bade","ja":"女の子、ずっとブツブツ言ってると\n思ったら急に叫びだすし！　め～っちゃ怖いじゃん！！","zh":"那个女孩子一直在碎碎念，\n结果突然叫了起来！超～吓人的好嘛！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"d0be9287b124b6f7c75e7867adb2ac5bc171fb348994a87e0310666cb8a51ac0","ja":"結局ホラー映画のような感想ばかりが出て、\n取材は終了。そしてその一か月後……","zh":"结果满口都是恐怖电影般的感想，\n取材便结束了。而那之后的一个月……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"e6e08d5100665abe97f6bc9f9c3fcb001cf267adee849083ab5af86bfc3c1ed6","ja":"（はぁ……オレたちの感想が載ってる雑誌、\nもう発売されてるんだよな……）","zh":"（唉……登了我们读后感的那本杂志，\n现在已经发售了吧……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"d8f47825135085ee9ceefb833f65c740d7cdb92fe2669eac5d0c32b853abe878","ja":"（映画のこと、もっと上手に宣伝できたら\nよかったんだけど……）","zh":"（要是能把电影宣传得\n更好一些就好了……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"6f45d6185274da9527a5fba53646fbf3b8224e83db990bac4dbe0c6875c8083c","ja":"あっ、昴さん。あの、これ……！","zh":"啊，昴。那个，这个……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"3490f2e89e2f3ebabbfbb4ed4bad61be7cf7c5b02e2afd29d91d689e425c0efd","ja":"なに、志保？\nこれって……ネットの映画ランキング……？","zh":"怎么了，志保？\n这难道是……网上的电影排行榜……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"44bf58e6bf62281993cec434f28fb4aed45046c1bad74361bbb956bf6d58d5e9","ja":"『ずっといっしょの約束』がランキング1位に\nなってるんです！　それで、その口コミが……。","zh":"《永远相伴的约定》排在排行榜第1名\n了！然后，上面的口碑评价……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"7cc3d809186473ad271aee5c5a83023abbc9bfcb20bf0858836ab24423aafc45","ja":"「エミリーちゃんと志保ちゃんの感想が気になって\n映画見てみた！　期待通りの恐怖が味わえて最高！」","zh":"“很好奇艾米莉和小志保的感想，\n所以去看了电影！体验到了如期待中的恐怖感，太棒了！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"90a1a67cef832fdfc57d7fe51f164b4af499e4411d7520dbeba91499abea96ba","ja":"「亜美ちゃんと昴ちゃんがすっごく怖い！って\n言うから見てみた！　確かにこれは怖すぎ！！」","zh":"“亚美和小昴一直说超级吓人！\n我就去看了看！这确实也太吓人了吧！！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"a22190c4a972a76f47500d730b6fc0b2534a020bd70d66282bdf9d481b62c0a0","ja":"ええっ！？　これって……オレたちの感想を見て、\nみんな見に行ってくれたってこと！？","zh":"诶诶！？　这难道是……大家看了我们的感想之后，\n都跑去看了吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"015ab9202b7830c9f40cd9bb50999f1e197ad74c6b12c5bc236eddb9605c1a5f","ja":"そうみたいです。なんだか私たちが怖がってたのが、\nみなさんの好奇心をあおったみたいで。","zh":"看起来是这样呢。总觉得好像是因为我们感到害怕，\n反而激发了大家的好奇心。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[49].text","source_sha256":"b273e15b58bc10a9802e6a0f31c079432f1ae287c03036323d891bdf395912e7","ja":"そっか……！　へへ、なんかラッキーヒットで\n大逆転って感じだけど……やったな、志保！","zh":"这样啊……！嘿嘿，感觉就像是走运打出了一记\n安打才大逆转的……不过干得漂亮，志保！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1082.unity3d","item_key":"commands[50].text","source_sha256":"033bdb0c3362d94a1ff21e06164978fa42b6c4aa1323335c38eacae684586580","ja":"はい。感じたことを素直にお伝えすることも、\n大切なんですね。","zh":"好的。坦率地传达自己的感受，\n也很重要呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
